# CS152 staff-only material.  These must never be tracked: .git/info/exclude is
# per-clone and does not survive a fresh clone, so the rule lives here instead.
# Naming them costs nothing -- the handout already says the mystery config is
# not in the student repository -- and it makes `git add -A` safe.
staff/
generators/chipyard/src/main/scala/cs152/CS152MysteryConfigs.scala
generators/chipyard/src/main/scala/cs152/CS152SolutionConfigs.scala
